---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
import { ChevronRight } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section class="section section-hero py-10 sm:py-20 my-0!">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 items-center gap-10">
      <div class="text-center sm:text-left">
        <h1>
          African clinicians, verified and placed{" "}
          <span
            class="bg-linear-to-r from-[#0179B4] to-[#88D8FF] bg-clip-text text-transparent"
            >where the shortage is worst.</span
          >
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-8 mb-10">
          MedicSupport Network sources nurses, doctors, midwives and paramedics
          across Africa, checks their registration, licence and identity
          against the issuing bodies, and places them with hospitals and health
          groups in{" "}
          <span class="text-main-200">Europe, the United States and the Gulf.</span>{" "}
          Every clinician we represent holds a public profile you can open before
          you make contact.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center sm:justify-start">
          <a
            href="/#apply"
            class="btn bg-[linear-gradient(125deg,var(--color-main-100),var(--color-main-200))] text-white border-0 rounded-xl text-lg py-3 px-6 h-auto shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl"
            >Register as a clinician <ChevronRight /></a
          >
          <a
            href="/#employers"
            class="btn border-2 border-main-200 bg-transparent text-white rounded-xl text-lg py-3 px-6 h-auto shadow-none hover:bg-white hover:text-black hover:border-white"
            >Source clinicians for your hospital</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="grid">
          <Image
            src="/img/img1.webp"
            alt="Illustrative reference image"
            format="webp"
            quality="45"
            fetchpriority="high"
            loading="eager"
            width="380"
            height="375"
            class="w-auto h-auto mx-auto [grid-area:1/1/2/2]"
          />
          <div class="[grid-area:1/1/2/2] mt-auto">
            <div
              class="border-main-200 border-2 rounded-xl p-5 bg-[linear-gradient(-125deg,#E9F6FF_0%,#ffffff_100%)] hidden sm:block sm:max-w-[46%] ml-auto"
            >
              <h3 class="text-main-200 mb-3">Checked before you ever call</h3>
              <ul class="text-black text-sm space-y-1.5">
                <li>Registration verified with the nursing or medical council</li>
                <li>Licence verified with the destination regulator</li>
                <li>Identity and right to work confirmed</li>
                <li>References and clinical history on file</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div
              class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow hidden sm:flex sm:max-w-[50%] text-main-200 text-lg items-center gap-3"
            >
              <svg class="icon" width="30" height="30">
                <use xlink:href="#star"></use>
              </svg>
              Africa &rarr; Europe &middot; United States &middot; Gulf
            </div>
            <div
              class="relative border-main-200 border-2 rounded-xl p-5 pt-8 bg-[linear-gradient(-125deg,#E9F6FF_0%,#ffffff_100%)] hidden sm:flex sm:max-w-[60%] ml-auto mt-10 -mb-10 before:content-[''] before:absolute before:w-16.25 before:h-16.25 before:bg-[url('/img/icons/quote.svg')] before:bg-contain before:bg-no-repeat before:-top-8 before:left-5 text-black"
            >
              We publish the credential, not just the CV. A hospital should be
              able to check a clinician before it books them, and a clinician
              should be able to show their record without emailing anyone.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>